-weight:700;font-size:14px\">Elite Thyroid Profile (Blood Spot)</div>\n<div style=\"color:#000;text-decoration:none;font-weight:300;font-size:13px\">Elite Thyroid Profile provides an assessment of thyroid health, including screening for hypo or hyperthyroidism, determining Free T4 and Free T3 levels, testing for autoimmune thyroid disease, and monitoring thyroid replacement dosages.</div>\n<p style=\"color:#a9a9a9;font-size:12px;font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:normal;\">$289.00</p>\n</td></tr></table></a>\n</td></tr></table></td></tr>\n\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px 20px\">\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"3px\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"min-width:100%;\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" class=\"t_shadow_block\">\n<a href=\"https://store.hrt.org/products/comprehensive-thyroid-profile-blood-urine-multi-test-kit-zrt-lab?_pos=7&_sid=bdc6f1021&_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"a_block\"><table><tr>\n<td width=\"30%\"><div style=\"height:120px;overflow:hidden\"><img alt=\"Comprehensive Thyroid Profile (Blood Spot/Urine)\" border=\"0\" class=\"w183\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0150/2081/8486/products/ZRTLabBloodUrineMultiTestKit_1024x1024@2x.jpg?v=1571716011\" style=\"width:120px;max-width:120px;height:auto;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" width=\"120\"></div></td>\n<td width=\"70%\" style=\"padding-right:15px\">\n<div style=\"font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;color:#4e525e;font-weight:700;font-size:14px\">Comprehensive Thyroid Profile (Blood Spot/Urine)</div>\n<div style=\"color:#000;text-decoration:none;font-weight:300;font-size:13px\">Comprehensive Thyroid Profile allows doctors to see if an individual has too little, or too much, iodine and selenium, and/or exposure to the iodine/selenium antagonists bromine, arsenic, and mercury.</div>\n<p style=\"color:#a9a9a9;font-size:12px;font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:normal;\">$319.00</p>\n</td></tr></table></a>\n</td></tr></table></td></tr>\n</table></td></tr>\n\n<